From 8e93e6d3cd94e2e5739020f10c6169002e36b68a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:38:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] datamap: add the Binder interface and the READ_DATA_MAP
 permission

org.sovereignos.permission.READ_DATA_MAP is signature|privileged and only the Data Map app holds it.
Structured parcelables, so that the app compiles the same files and no hand-written Parcelable is
needed.
